Test: [tests.zip](https://github.com/rstudio/shinytest/files/3590586/tests.zip)

For example, the `tab2_output` never gets recorded in the  shinytest snapshot, even if tabs are switched (notably, tab switching doesn't get recorded either). 

app.R:
```
library(shiny)
library(shinydashboard)


ui <- dashboardPage(skin = "yellow",
    dashboardHeader(title = "where my tab outputs at"),
    dashboardSidebar(
        sidebarMenu(
            sliderInput("tab1_num", "select number for FIRST tabpanel", min=1, max=100, value=20, step=1), 
            sliderInput("tab2_num", "select number for SECOND tabpanel", min=101, max=200, value=150, step=1) 
        )
    ),
    dashboardBody(
        tabBox(width=12, 
            tabPanel("FIRST tabpanel",      
                textOutput("tab1_output")
            ),
            tabPanel("SECOND tabpanel",      
                textOutput("tab2_output")
            )
        )
    )
